      "user_id": 78863,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769620972066665
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. One moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see the order for the VeloBand GPS Tracker. It looks like it was delivered about 44 days ago. What seems to be the issue with the band?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
